Building a home loan prepayment calculator for Indian home loans.
- Frontend: Next.js 14 + TypeScript
- Backend: NestJS 10 + TypeScript  
- Database: PostgreSQL 15 + Prisma
- Complete documentation in /docs/ folder (8 specification documents)

